      "title": "GitHub - lx709/VRSBench",
      "url": "https://github.com/lx709/VRSBench",
      "snippet": "VRSBench is a Versatile Vision-Language Benchmark for Remote Sensing Image Understanding. It consists of 29,614 remote sensing images with detailed captions, 52,472 object refers, and 123,221 visual question-answer pairs. It facilitates the training and evaluation of vision-language models across a broad spectrum of remote sensing image understanding tasks."
